{"name":"The Handoff Glass","slug":"glyph-handoff-glass","blurb":"On the bind street, Joss carries the glass toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Handoff. Click the glass and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Handoff Glass.","seal":"463629ba770a65052d76b7e47b4a992c02c5a2bcb5a1567b5986c9b15a8903e6"}
